# Everything here runs through lint-staged, scoped by path (see "lint-staged"
# in the root package.json). Keep it that way: a hook that runs the whole
# check suite on every commit gets bypassed with --no-verify, and a bypassed
# hook catches nothing. CI runs the full suite (`pnpm check`) on every PR.
#
# --concurrent false because the tasks are not independent: the `*.{ts,tsx}`
# task runs `pnpm typecheck`, which builds, which starts by `rm -rf dist` —
# deleting the component manifest that the `.claude/skills/*.md` task is
# reading at that moment. Run in parallel they race and the commit fails with
# "Component manifest not found"; run in sequence either order is fine.
pnpm lint-staged --concurrent false
